{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\ndef main():\n    rounds = int(input())\n    alice = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    bob = list(map(int, input().split()))\n    \n    bob = bob[1:] + [bob[0]]\n    min_victory, max_victory = 0, 0\n    \n    for idx in range(rounds):\n        max_victory += min(alice[idx], bob[idx])\n    \n    top_bob = max(bob)\n    for idx in range(rounds):\n        if bob[idx] == top_bob and bob[idx] + alice[idx] > min_victory:\n            min_victory = bob[idx] + alice[idx]\n    \n    top_alice = max(alice)\n    for idx in range(rounds):\n        if alice[idx] == top_alice and alice[idx] + bob[idx] > min_victory:\n            min_victory = alice[idx] + bob[idx]\n    \n    min_victory = max(0, min_victory - rounds)\n    print(f'{min_victory} {max_victory}')\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        \n        int rounds = Integer.parseInt(scanner.nextLine());\n        String[] aliceLine = scanner.nextLine().split(\" \");\n        String[] bobLine = scanner.nextLine().split(\" \");\n        \n        int[] alice = new int[rounds];\n        int[] bob = new int[rounds];\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < rounds; i++) {\n            alice[i] = Integer.parseInt(aliceLine[i]);\n        }\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < rounds; i++) {\n            bob[i] = Integer.parseInt(bobLine[i]);\n        }\n        \n        // Rotate bob array: move first element to the end\n        int firstBob = bob[0];\n        for (int i = 0; i < rounds - 1; i++) {\n            bob[i] = bob[i + 1];\n        }\n        bob[rounds - 1] = firstBob;\n        \n        int min_victory = 0;\n        int max_victory = 0;\n        \n        for (int idx = 0; idx < rounds; idx++) {\n            max_victory += Math.min(alice[idx], bob[idx]);\n        }\n        \n        int top_bob = bob[0];\n        for (int i = 1; i < rounds; i++) {\n            if (bob[i] > top_bob) {\n                top_bob = bob[i];\n            }\n        }\n        \n        for (int idx = 0; idx < rounds; idx++) {\n            if (bob[idx] == top_bob && bob[idx] + alice[idx] > min_victory) {\n                min_victory = bob[idx] + alice[idx];\n            }\n        }\n        \n        int top_alice = alice[0];\n        for (int i = 1; i < rounds; i++) {\n            if (alice[i] > top_alice) {\n                top_alice = alice[i];\n            }\n        }\n        \n        for (int idx = 0; idx < rounds; idx++) {\n            if (alice[idx] == top_alice && alice[idx] + bob[idx] > min_victory) {\n                min_victory = alice[idx] + bob[idx];\n            }\n        }\n        \n        min_victory = Math.max(0, min_victory - rounds);\n        System.out.println(min_victory + \" \" + max_victory);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-5.459636304294